.tools
target/

# macOS writes these into any directory Finder has opened. Not build output and not a
# decision like the local-only list below — just noise from the OS, ignored wherever it
# lands rather than at the repo root only.
.DS_Store

# Local-only working material, kept OUT of the repo by user decision. Deliberately listed
# by path rather than by a pattern: a pattern invites new files to be assumed covered, and
# the point of the list is that adding to it is a decision. Enforced by
# `static_audit::local_only_paths_are_not_tracked`, because a .gitignore entry does NOT
# untrack a file that is already tracked — which is exactly how scale-audit.md reached
# origin/main and sat there for three landings.
docs/scale-audit.md
docs/production-audit.md
crates/api/console-dist/
docs/distribution.md
